# The nightly run (docs/FUZZING.md, "In CI"): four workers for fifteen
# minutes, growing the corpus the next night starts from. The initial
# candidate of issue 681's budget plan; docs/FUZZ_EVALUATION.md, section 12,
# says what it was chosen over and what is not known about it.
#
#   <worker> <target> <weight> <sanitizer>
wall 900
reserve 60
1 ir 900 none
2 ir 900 none
3 differential 900 none
4 image 300 address
4 ir_mutate 300 none
4 differential_source 300 none
